# --- Data -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Derived artefacts: always ignored, always rebuildable via `make data`.
data/processed/

# The raw scoresheet is NOT committed yet. It contains named startups from the
# Plug and Play deal pipeline alongside personal invest/pass verdicts, so making it
# public is a deliberate decision that has not been taken.
#
# Committing it (or an anonymised release of it) is what makes the paper's results
# reproducible by a third party. See the "confidentiality" section of the README.
# To publish: drop the Name and url columns, relabel sessions S01..S23, commit that
# file instead, and delete the line below.
data/raw/

# Frozen CV split manifests ARE committed — they are what make results from different
# sessions directly comparable. (No exclusion needed; listed here as a reminder.)

